<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15045" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρίθμ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, =
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>numerical,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Comm.Math.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; 
			<i>by number,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρίθμια σῦκα ρ́</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					529.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astrol., <i>determining number,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῆρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					145.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					278.30
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>reckoned, counted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτ᾽ ἀθανάτοισιν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Rhian.
					1.16
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν καὶ ὄνος κείνοισιν
			ἀ.</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.151
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέρες ἐν Λιβύεσσιν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					263
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταρίθμιος,
			ἐναρίθμιος.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρίθμιον, τό,</span>
			<i>set, series</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				544.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
